Okuphumayo bhala: (['a:b:'] - [':']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['-'] - ['--']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ([''] - ['--']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['--'] - ['']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ([''] - ['']), umugqa-omusha.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: y, umugqa-omusha.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x buyisela: [''] nge: ['xx'].
Okuphumayo bhala: ((x kuyefana: y) lokhu: ['OK'] noma-lokho: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), umugqa-omusha.